 "remarks": "This updated condo in Stamford's Springdale neighborhood offers comfort, convenience, and easy living. Recently Renovate with new floors, bath appliances and paint. The open living and dining area that is perfect for entertaining. The spacious bedroom has great closets and a full bath. Enjoy the convenience of laundry on the same floor just a few doors down, elevator access, a fitness room, and one reserved parking spaces/presently in the garage off the lobby (ask agent). The HOA includes heat, hot water, and cooking gas. Just minutes to the Metro North Springdale station, as well as neighborhood restaurants and shops, this home delivers exceptional value in a prime location",
